    "### 4.3 Best Model Evaluation on Test Set\n",
    "We select the model with the highest Validation ROC-AUC and evaluate its performance on the held-out **Test Set** to confirm generalizability."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c4b56105",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
